    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "\n\n\n\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Vanguard Warforged heritage</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You make an attack roll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your innate combat ability enables you to strengthen your attack. You gain a +1 status bonus to the triggering attack roll.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"> </p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Enhancement</strong> ou can execute a series of practised blows to take advantage of this surge of strength, the +1 status bonus applies to each attack roll you make until the start of your next turn. </p>\n"
    },
